{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": [
    "cost is the shop price. Drop-only items have cost null and a 'value' used when selling (sell price = value * rules.gold.sellFactor).",
    "unique: true means having two gives the bonus only once.",
    "charges: consumables. stackMax is how many charges fit in one slot.",
    "active items are used with the item hotkey. cooldownGroup shares a cooldown between items.",
    "recipe: the item is made from its components plus a fee. cost = all component costs + fee. Buying it uses the components the hero carries (they count at their cost), the rest is paid in gold. Upgrades are recipes that use the item before them.",
    "aura: allies (heroes and units) within radius get these bonuses while the hero carries the item. role: mage, warrior, tank, support or damage (shop tabs and bots).",
    "New stats: spellDamagePct (more spell damage), cooldownReductionPct (shorter ability cooldowns), spellResistPct (less spell damage taken), healPowerPct (stronger heals), critChancePct (chance to hit for rules.items.critMultiplier x damage), maxMana. Caps in rules.json items.caps."
  ],
